<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 23.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 23.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Sept 23     Sept 20	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  239.800     240.860     237,040    1.16 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.070     301.650     303.640   -0.85 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.130     158.845     165.490   -4.45 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.700	46.874	48.410   -3.53 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  372.420     374.200     366.280    1.68 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.025     141.715     147.886   -4.64 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.726	15.804	14.975    5.02 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  218.150     219.480     230.135   -5.21 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.879	 1.890	 1.939   -3.09 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.552	 1.559	 1.575   -1.46 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  193.440     194.000     206.030   -6.11 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
